<title>USA: Digi Intl unveils high-speed adapter.</title>
<headline>Digi Intl unveils high-speed adapter.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digi International Inc said it developed the DataFire PCI ISDN adapter to provide high-speed ISDN Internet connections to Sun Microsystems Inc Sun Solaris system users.</p>
<p>Sun Microsystems will offer a Point-to-Point Protocol stack that works with Digi's Solstice drivers for Solaris systems.</p>
<p>	 (-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787)</p>
